# The captured batch slice installs both memberships but folds only the first
# key's retract/add into the slots.
MODULE: SlotsMatchMembershipBatchMissesKey
TARGET: SlotsMatchMembership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a batch flip folds only the first key's delta into the slots
PERTURBS: FlushBatch

--- FIND
           s1 == Add(Retract(Add(Retract(slots, mem[1]), m1[1]), mem[2]), m1[2])
--- REPLACE
           s1 == Add(Retract(slots, mem[1]), m1[1])
--- END
